{
  "_comment": [
    "FW-126.7 phase-current calibration report - the 0x602D schema 2 payload, defined ONCE.",
    "",
    "Both decoders read their offsets from here: the PowerShell one opens this file, the JS",
    "one mirrors it and tests/fw1267_cal_parity.js fails if the mirror differs by a single",
    "field. Producer: src/CAN_Display.c current_cal_serialize_dump().",
    "",
    "THREE DOMAINS, NEVER MIXED:",
    "  physical ADC result = JDR + IOFF   -> the 'midpoint_*' fields, ~2020 at zero current",
    "  JDR                 = hardware-offset-corrected inserted result (small, signed)",
    "                        -> mean_*, min_*, max_*, p2p_*",
    "  software offset     = what the FOC ISR subtracts from JDR -> offset_*",
    "Never call JDR 'raw ADC' without qualification.",
    "",
    "flags: 0x01 valid, 0x02 timeout hit, 0x04 MOE on + compares neutral for every sample,",
    "0x08 FOC blocked during calibration (structural - the only sampling call site is the",
    "dwell branch of the FOC ISR), 0x10 DIAG post-validation stop was spent."
